 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
 /*
- * GXP timer driver
+ * GXP board support
  *
  * (C) Copyright 2022 Hewlett Packard Enterprise Development LP.
  * Author: Nick Hawkins <nick.hawkins@hpe.com>
  * Author: Jean-Marie Verdun <verdun@hpe.com>
