+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later OR MIT
+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2016-2026 TQ-Systems GmbH <u-boot@ew.tq-group.com>,
+ * D-82229 Seefeld, Germany.
+ * Author: Max Merchel
+ *
+ * TQMa6UL environment
+ */
